# TEMPORARY DEBUG TOOL smoke: tune panel (F12) - variant flip + staged passes.
# Geometry locked by test_tune_panel.h::test_script_geometry_lock (panel rect,
# variant rows, clear/apply). Ops-row clicks derive from the same layout:
# +f center (278,165), +a center (306,165).
# Passes are STAGED via +f/+a rather than relying on Reset-to-config: a config
# whose roger_omyac_passes tokens don't parse (e.g. numeric "2 1") yields an
# empty live pass list, which would make Clear/Reset/Apply all no-ops.
wait 4500
snap tune-baseline
key f12
wait 500
snap tune-open
click 273 75
wait 1500
snap tune-variant-mmpx3
click 273 31
wait 1500
snap tune-variant-ship
click 278 165
wait 300
click 306 165
wait 300
snap tune-staged
click 303 177
wait 5000
snap tune-applied
click 244 177
wait 300
click 303 177
wait 5000
snap tune-wireframe
key f12
wait 500
snap tune-closed
quit
